268
00:19:33.964 --> 00:19:36.550
Dan anda membaca penafian
dan klausa had liabiliti?

269
00:19:36.634 --> 00:19:38.511
Ya, ia sangat teliti.

270
00:19:38.594 --> 00:19:39.804
{\an8}Tiada celah juga.

271
