428
00:29:19.091 --> 00:29:20.008
{\an8}Ya, Yang Berhormat.

429
00:29:20.634 --> 00:29:21.927
Kami menuntut 500 juta won.

430
00:29:25.055 --> 00:29:27.432
Peguam Plaintif, apa yang anda katakan?

431
00:29:29.977 --> 00:29:33.230
Kami akui sperma telah hilang
akibat kecuaian.

432
00:29:33.313 --> 00:29:36.400
{\an8}Tetapi walaupun dengan situasi defendan,

433
00:29:36.483 --> 00:29:38.986
